# Vendored third-party single-header libraries. They are taken from upstream as
# they are and are not maintained here, so their findings are not actionable:
#   cm_compress.h  miniz v1.12 (public domain)
#   cm_mailer.h    jwSMTP (GPLv2)
# miniz's decompressor is a switch-based coroutine that restores its state on
# re-entry; cppcheck cannot follow that control flow and reports every variable
# it restores as used-before-set, plus the NULL+0 pointer arithmetic its API
# uses to mean "no output buffer".
*:server/src/cm_compress.h
*:server/src/cm_mailer.h
